  "contentHtml": "<p style=\"text-align: left;\">안녕하세요?<br>작년부터 관심 있던 분야 였는데<br>이렇게 게시판이 생기니 너무 좋습니다^^<br><br>참고하면 좋을 책들을 소개합니다.<br></p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/b11cfdaf45fa23c7e26637092545cc769de6449f\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/b11cfdaf45fa23c7e26637092545cc769de6449f\" data-orgin-width=\"480\" data-origin-height=\"640\"></div><p style=\"text-align: left;\">아래는 목차입니다.<br></p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/c141c4cf2ec2072fd9fae8df40e930f7aaff3d53\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/c141c4cf2ec2072fd9fae8df40e930f7aaff3d53\" data-orgin-width=\"480\" data-origin-height=\"640\"></div><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/f579e1ec17116e965bf54b49a4d9ab8bc06a6189\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/f579e1ec17116e965bf54b49a4d9ab8bc06a6189\" data-orgin-width=\"480\" data-origin-height=\"640\"></div><p style=\"text-align: left;\">잘 보이는지 모르겠네요; <br>책의 내용 구성은 이런식 입니다.</p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/6bed27fadd5f1212f3357e42b874550110968ea9\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/6bed27fadd5f1212f3357e42b874550110968ea9\" data-orgin-width=\"480\" data-origin-height=\"360\"></div><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/0ab30533b73fe00e8cb0c09f49a202dfb97891