 data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/ebbfd8b38b2c562cbb56b649dbaa9f1d57009e0a\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/ebbfd8b38b2c562cbb56b649dbaa9f1d57009e0a\" data-orgin-width=\"480\" data-origin-height=\"640\"></div><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/194cbd9324fee5a23c155c7dc93a5640af354f81\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/194cbd9324fee5a23c155c7dc93a5640af354f81\" data-orgin-width=\"480\" data-origin-height=\"360\"></div><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/847bffb17e6cf8289733612578388d82f03d83ce\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/847bffb17e6cf8289733612578388d82f03d83ce\" data-orgin-width=\"480\" data-origin-height=\"640\"></div><p style=\"text-align: left;\">작년에 방과후수업을 계획하며 산 책입니다. 코로나때메 취소 되었지요ㅠ<br><br>더 좋은 책들 있으면 공유 부탁드립니다^ ^<br><br></p>\n\t \t\t\t\t\t<!-- -->",
